<mjml>
    <mj-head>
        <mj-title>EdgeCDN-X Newsletter - October 2026</mj-title>
        <mj-preview>Explore healthcheck history and watch DNS-based request routing in EdgeCDN-X.</mj-preview>
        <mj-attributes>
            <mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
            <mj-text color="#353333" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" />
            <mj-button background-color="#3472ed" color="#ffffff" border-radius="5px" />
        </mj-attributes>
    </mj-head>

    <mj-body background-color="#f4f6fb">
        <mj-section background-color="#3472ed" padding="10px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-image
                    src="https://edgecdnx.fra1.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/public/Logo%20Transparency%20white.png"
                    alt="EdgeCDN-X" width="250px" align="center" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="10px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-text>
                    <h2 style="color: #1E90FF; margin-top: 0;">October 2026 Newsletter</h2>
                    <p><b>Hello everyone,</b></p>
                    <p>
                        This month, take a closer look at healthcheck history in the EdgeCDN-X location view,
                        and watch DNS-based request routing in action.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        EdgeCDN-X provides DNS-based global server load balancing to direct requests to suitable
                        edge locations. Choose from static answers, weighted distribution, primary-and-fallback
                        failover, geolocation and IP-prefix routing, or round-robin selection. Health checks,
                        maintenance state, and active alerts help determine which nodes are eligible, while
                        Kubernetes resources keep routing configuration declarative.
                    </p>
                </mj-text>

                <mj-text>
                    <h4 style="color: #1E90FF;">From OTLP Logs to Healthcheck History</h4>
                    <p>
                        Learn how probe results travel through OTLP logs, Fluent Bit, NATS, Benthos, and
                        TimescaleDB to power recent per-node healthcheck history. The location view helps
                        operators inspect pass/fail results, probe durations, and failure messages.
                    </p>
                </mj-text>
                <mj-button
                    href="https://edgecdnx.com/blog/from-otlp-logs-to-healthcheck-history-in-edge-cdn-x@TrackLink"
                    target="_blank"
                    padding="10px 0 24px">
                    Read the blog post
                </mj-button>

                <mj-text>
                    <h4 style="color: #1E90FF;">DNS-Based Request Routing</h4>
                    <p>
                        Watch the video about DNS-based request routing with EdgeCDN-X.
                    </p>
                </mj-text>
                <mj-image
                    src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/eTIqW8aCeQY/hqdefault.jpg"
                    alt="DNS based request routing with EdgeCDN-X"
                    href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eTIqW8aCeQY@TrackLink"
                    target="_blank"
                    width="400px" />
                <mj-text align="center" color="#3472ed">
                    <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eTIqW8aCeQY@TrackLink"
                        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        style="color:#3472ed;text-decoration:none;">
                        DNS based request routing with EdgeCDN-X
                    </a>
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section background-color="#353333" padding="20px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-social mode="horizontal" icon-size="24px" align="center">
                    <mj-social-element name="youtube" href="https://www.youtube.com/@edgecdnx@TrackLink"
                        background-color="#01b1ff" />
                    <mj-social-element name="x" href="https://x.com/EdgecdnX@TrackLink" background-color="#01b1ff" />
                    <mj-social-element name="github" href="https://github.com/EdgeCDN-X@TrackLink"
                        background-color="#01b1ff" />
                </mj-social>

                <mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" color="#ffffff">
                    2026 TboTech s.r.o. - EdgeCDN-X<br></br>Slovakia
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section background-color="#ffffff">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-raw>
                    <div class="footer" style="text-align: center;font-size: 12px;color: #888;">
                        <p>
                            <a href="{{ UnsubscribeURL }}" style="color: #888;">Unsubscribe</a>
                            &nbsp;&nbsp;
                            <a href="{{ MessageURL }}" style="color: #888;">View in browser</a>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="gutter" style="padding: 30px;">&nbsp;{{ TrackView }}</div>
                </mj-raw>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>
    </mj-body>
</mjml>
